    <item>
      <title>网关信号不好？先看这几条</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/zh/troubleshooting/gateway-signal/</link>
      <pubDate>Sun, 10 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/zh/troubleshooting/gateway-signal/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;和 &lt;strong&gt;故障排除&lt;/strong&gt; 里「设备老掉线」那条一起看：先在中心页按步骤做，再看下面两个常见问题。&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div itemscope itemtype=&#34;https://schema.org/FAQPage&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;accordion-item linktrol-ts-faq-item border-0 shadow-sm mb-2 rounded overflow-hidden&#34; itemscope itemprop=&#34;mainEntity&#34; itemtype=&#34;https://schema.org/Question&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;h2 class=&#34;accordion-header h5 mb-0&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;button class=&#34;accordion-button collapsed py-3&#34; type=&#34;button&#34; data-bs-toggle=&#34;collapse&#34; data-bs-target=&#34;#faq-0-108facb05c4d570159fa1c55d42bd084&#34; aria-expanded=&#34;false&#34; aria-controls=&#34;faq-0-108facb05c4d570159fa1c55d42bd084&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;span itemprop=&#34;name&#34;&gt;先挪网关还是先加中继？&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/button&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div id=&#34;faq-0-108facb05c4d570159fa1c55d42bd084&#34; class=&#34;accordion-collapse collapse&#34; role=&#34;region&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;accordion-body border-top&#34; itemscope itemprop=&#34;acceptedAnswer&#34; itemtype=&#34;https://schema.org/Answer&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div itemprop=&#34;text&#34;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;一次动一处&lt;/strong&gt;：先把网关或插电中继挪近信号差的设备，中间少隔墙。确认不是金属电箱、微波炉挡路，再考虑多买中继。&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;accordion-item linktrol-ts-faq-item border-0 shadow-sm mb-2 rounded overflow-hidden&#34; itemscope itemprop=&#34;mainEntity&#34; itemtype=&#34;https://schema.org/Question&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;h2 class=&#34;accordion-header h5 mb-0&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;button class=&#34;accordion-button collapsed py-3&#34; type=&#34;button&#34; data-bs-toggle=&#34;collapse&#34; data-bs-target=&#34;#faq-1-108facb05c4d570159fa1c55d42bd084&#34; aria-expanded=&#34;false&#34; aria-controls=&#34;faq-1-108facb05c4d570159fa1c55d42bd084&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;span itemprop=&#34;name&#34;&gt;路由器换信道会影响 Zigbee 吗？&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/button&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div id=&#34;faq-1-108facb05c4d570159fa1c55d42bd084&#34; class=&#34;accordion-collapse collapse&#34; role=&#34;region&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;accordion-body border-top&#34; itemscope itemprop=&#34;acceptedAnswer&#34; itemtype=&#34;https://schema.org/Answer&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div itemprop=&#34;text&#34;&gt;会。很多 Zigbee 也在 2.4 GHz。路由器老换信道会干扰。可以试试固定 Wi‑Fi 信道，或把 USB 网关棒用延长线拉离路由器。&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;linktrol-upgrade-banner card border-0 shadow-sm my-4&#34; role=&#34;complementary&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&#34;card-body d-flex flex-column flex-md-row gap-3 align-items-md-center&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;flex-grow-1&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;h3 class=&#34;h6 fw-bold mb-2&#34;&gt;&lt;i class=&#34;fa-solid fa-arrow-trend-up me-2 text-warning&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;设备用了好几年？&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div class=&#34;small text-body-secondary mb-0&#34;&gt;老网关有时修不如换。发邮件写上型号和购买渠道，我们帮你对接升级或优惠。&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;flex-shrink-0&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;btn btn-warning btn-sm text-dark&#34; href=&#34;mailto:linktrol@icloud.com?subject=%E7%BD%91%E5%85%B3%E5%8D%87%E7%BA%A7%E4%BC%98%E6%83%A0%E5%88%B8&#34;&gt;发邮件问换新&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
